  "content": "High occupancy is a good problem to have, until there\u2019s no room left for flexibility.\n\nWhen housing teams are operating near full capacity, even small disruptions can create bigger operational challenges. Room changes, accommodations, late demand, and resident needs all become harder to absorb, especially when teams are already lean.\n\nThis week\u2019s Takeaway Tuesday looks at what it means to run housing in an environment where both beds and teams are stretched.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Swipe through for the takeaway.\n\nFind more insights from the 2026 State of the Student Housing Industry Report in the comments.\n\n#StudentHousing #HigherEducation #HousingOperations #ResidenceLife #StarRez",
